# Reviewer selection template for AGENTS.md rule 11: the distinct second agent
# that double-checks unattended commits and merges.
#
# Copy this file to config/reviewer.local (gitignored) and set your own values.
# This is a template, not a repo default: the individual owner chooses the
# reviewer.
#
# REVIEWER_AGENT: agent to use (for example `general`, `explore`, or `prompt`
# to ask at the start of every task instead of reusing a stored pick).
# REVIEWER_MODEL: primary reviewer as `provider/modelID[#variant]`, where the
# modelID may include an `@quantization` suffix (local models use this).
# Omit the variant for the provider default effort.
# REVIEWER_FALLBACK_1..3: optional fallbacks in preference order, same format.
REVIEWER_AGENT=<agent or prompt>
REVIEWER_MODEL=<provider/modelID[#variant]>
REVIEWER_FALLBACK_1=<provider/modelID[#variant]>
REVIEWER_FALLBACK_2=<provider/modelID[#variant]>
REVIEWER_FALLBACK_3=<provider/modelID[#variant]>
